#[navbar]

#[section, $md:
    @../ (Documentation) / Functions

    # Functions

    Moth functions use named declarations rather than anonymous closures or
    general function values. A signature records each parameter's type and
    access mode, then lists every success and error return.

    Calls stay local and explicit. The source shows named arguments, mutable
    access and failure propagation where they occur.
]

